# ─── L4D2-launcher .gitignore ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source of truth that IS tracked: bridge/*.c, *.h, *.py, *.def; the two
# *.patch files; play-l4d2.sh; sign-in.sh; build-deps.sh; README.md; sdk/.
# Everything below is a build artifact, a multi-GB dependency, a runtime
# prefix, or a log — all reproducible from the tracked source.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore does NOT support trailing comments on a pattern line —
# the comment text becomes part of the pattern.  Keep comments on their own.

# Wine prefixes (runtime state, GBs)
prefix/
whisky-prefix/

# Bundled third-party runtimes (downloaded by play-l4d2.sh)
whisky-wine/
Game Porting Toolkit.app/

# Built binaries (reproducible via build-deps.sh / play-l4d2.sh build-bridge)
bridge/steam_api.dll
bridge/steam_helper
# vtables_generated.c is regenerated from sdk/ headers by gen_vtables.py
bridge/vtables_generated.c
dxvk-build/*.dll
moltenvk-build/*.dylib

# DXVK pipeline-state / shader cache (regenerated at runtime)
dxvk-shaders/
*.dxvk-cache

# Superseded: old C++ bridge, replaced by steam_api_wine.c
bridge/steam_api_wine.cpp
# Superseded: full SDK dump; the live headers used by the build are in sdk/
bridge/sdk_old/

# Logs
*.log

# macOS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
